      "writtenOn": "2023-01-13T17:32:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, this allows mappings with default attributes (info we can afford losing) to be folded into a block mapping. So with this change, coalescing will be effective for a block where we have default mapping + annotations.\n\nIt\u0027s not a big deal, but it should probably be separated into a different patch for later upstream submission.",
