        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-16T12:09:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suppose without the refcounting, you would see coalescing in the a following case (all entries of a table have owner_id !\u003d0)\n\n```\npkvm_host_donate_hyp(XX, nr_pages\u003d512);\n\n...\n\npkvm_hyp_donate_host(XXm nr_pages\u003d512);\n\n```\n\nOr even with less pages with owner_id !\u003d 0, if the other entries of the tables have never been accessed.",
      "parentUuid": "2709f52b_e16335e4",
